      "note": [
        "The transitional grant are intendeed to support municipalities and county councils that has a declined outcome when the local government equalisation changed from Government grant and intramunicipal equalisation to Economic equalisation.",
        "The calculations behind income equalisation where changed year 2005",
        "The general government grant is from 2005 a part of the income equalisation and regulationgrant/fee.",
        "The regualtiongrant/fee is intended to make the government cost equal to the government  grant.",
        "The Structuralgrant is a constant.",
        "From january 2007 did the municipality of Heby change county from Västmanland to Uppsala."
